# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Title: Crypto Firewall - Suricata Ruleset
# Description: Detects malicious domains and IP addresses associated with
# crypto malware, phishing, scams, and malicious automation.
#
# Homepage: https://github.com/chartingshow/crypto-firewall
# Contribute: https://github.com/chartingshow/crypto-firewall/issues
# License: GPL-3.0
#
# Format: Suricata IDS/IPS Rules
# Last modified: 12 October 2026
# Expires: 24 hours
#
# SID Range:
# 100000000-499999999
#
# Notes:
# - Generated automatically
# - Designed for Suricata-compatible IDS/IPS engines
# - Uses TLS SNI inspection
# - Primarily designed for domain and hostname indicators
# - Requires TLS metadata visibility
# - Does not decrypt encrypted payloads
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IPv4 ADDRESSES
# Malicious IPv4 addresses associated with crypto abuse activity.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

